            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugurura inzugi zawe, Lebanoni, umuriro uturire ibiti vyawe vy’amasederi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vuza induru, wa giti c’umuberoshi, kukw isederi ihenutse, kand’ ibiti vyiza‐vyiza bikaba vyononekaye. Ni muvuze induru, mwa biti vy’ imyeloni vy’i Bashani, kukw ikibira kitāmenwa gihindikiranye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 25:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umve induru z’abungere, kukw icubahiro cabo catītūtse. Umve imigunza y’intambge yivuga, kuk’ ukuberwa kwa Yorodani kwononekaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho Imana yanje agize, ati Ragira umukuku w’imbāgwa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 34:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 12:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abazihanjuye ni bo bazicumita, bakibgira ko badacumuye, n’abazishōye bakavuga, bat’ Uhoraho ashimwe, kuko mbaye umutunzi; kand’ abungere bazo na bo nta kagongwe zibatera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.13.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 13:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ntazosubira guterwa akagongwe n’ababa mur’ iki gihugu, ni k’Uhoraho agize; ariko nzobagabura, umuntu wese ndamute mu kuboko kw’uwamuragira, no mu kuboko kw’umwami wiwe; abo bazorya igihugu, kandi sinzobarokora ngo mbakūre mu maboko yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nca ndagira umukuku w’imbāgwa, mbere zar’ intama z’imyaku. Maze nābīra inkoni zibiri, imwe ndayita Buntu, iyindi ndayita Yungiro; nuko ndagira umukuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kumwe ngeseza ba bungere batatu; kuk’ umutima wanje war’ ubarambiwe, kandi n’iyabo yari yanzinutswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 15:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ndavuga, nti Namwe sinkibaragira; ūpfa n’apfe, ūranduka n’arunduke, amasigarira n’aryane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nābīra ya nkoni yanje Buntu, ndayivunamwo kubiri, kugira ngo nice isezerano nasezeranye n’amahanga yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo musi iravunika; maz’ intama z’imyaku zanyumvira zica zimenya yukw iryo jambo ar’ iry’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 21:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndababarira, nti Namba mubona kw ari vyiza, ni mumpe ingero yanje; bitabaye vyiza, musigeho. Nuko bangerera intete mirongwitatu z’ifeza kw ingero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho arambgira, ati Terera umubumvyi ako kaminuza k’igiciro banciriye! Nuko nābīra za ntete z’ifeza mirongwitatu, ndazijana nziterera umubumvyi mu nzu y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ inkoni yanje ya kabiri yitwa Yungiro nca ndayivunamwo kubiri, kugira ngo nice umuvukano w’Abayuda n’ Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho arambgira, ati Subira wābīre ibiragizwa vy’ umwungere mubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 34:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.10.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 10:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko rāba, nzohagurutsa umwungere mu gihugu, atazobabara izizimiye, kandi ntazorondera izāsābagiye, n’ izivunitse ntazozunga, canke ngw aragire izigihagaze; arikw azorya inyama z’izivyibushe, mber’ azoguguna n’inzāra zazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.23.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 23:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azobona ibara, uwo mwungere w’imburakimazi ata umukuku! Inkota izomukubita ku kuboko, no ku jisho ry’i buryo: ukuboko kwiwe kuzonyunyuka rwose, kand’ ijisho ryiwe ry’i buryo rizohuma agahenebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
